# Deterministic line endings: LF in every checkout on every platform (Windows contributors included).
# Files already stored with CRLF in the index keep their stored form (git does not rewrite them under text=auto).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
